@startuml
' Artifact: CapsuleAI Logical View
' Version: 0.1; Status: Baseline Draft; Date: 2026-10-10
' Source: ADD v0.1 + Selected Architecture Decisions v0.1.1 (ADA-001-018 Selected)
' Source versions are authoring baselines; navigation-only patches leave their meaning unchanged.
' Scope: logical/domain responsibilities only; decomposition accepted by the human, 2026-10-10.
' Navigation update only: Implementation View v0.1 exists; logical owners/dependencies unchanged.
' Note: not deployment, source-code/package, physical-data or detailed-contract design.
' Process: Initial files/CapsuleAI_Scrum_Development_Workflow.md, Sections 21/39-43/46.
' Requirements: BRD v0.3; PRD v0.2; SRS v0.3; Business Rules v0.1.2.
' Architecture: ADD Sections 3/5-10/12-13; ASR-SEC-001/002, REL-001/002,
' CON-001, PERF-001, INT-001, USE-001, TEST-001; existing QA scenarios unchanged.
' Whole repository re-read; per-boundary SRS/rules and all 23 UCs re-read before allocation.
'
' Domain reasoning: capabilities -> invariants -> language -> owners -> boundaries -> contracts.
' Identity: CAP-01; UC-001-004/AD-004; FR-AUTH; BRULE-AUTH; DATA-AUTH-001/002/005.
' Separate access/recovery from optional advice context; profile completeness never gates access.
' Personal Context: CAP-01; UC-005/006/AD-006; FR-PROF/WEATHER; BRULE-PROF.
' Keep selected environmental acquisition with personal context; no Weather bounded context.
' Wardrobe: CAP-02-04; UC-007-010/AD-007; FR-AI/GAR/WAR; BRULE-GAR; DATA-GAR.
' AI assistance and media lifecycle stay inside the confirmed-garment owner's responsibility.
' Outfit Advice and Use: CAP-05/06 + reported-use CAP-07; UC-011-018;
' AD-011/012/014/016/017; BRULE-OUT/PERS/WEAR/HIST; DATA-OUT/WEAR/HIST.
' Combine styling and behavior to keep exact targets, survivor effects and ranking coherent,
' avoiding mutual context calls; semantic evaluation is published separately within this owner.
' Wardrobe Intelligence: Coverage CAP-07 + CAP-08-10; UC-019-023;
' AD-019/020/021/022; BRULE-COV/GAP/MULT/SHOP; DATA-ANL-001-004.
' Keep capability gaps and complete candidate utility together; no separate Catalog/Commerce BC.
' Product Measurement: supporting responsibility, FR-MET-001-007/DATA-RET-003; no actor goal.
' Extraction review: Identity adds current-authority remote coupling; Context adds freshness/
' withdrawal coupling; Wardrobe adds confirmation/removal/media coherence; Outfit adds current
' wardrobe/context acceptance and basis coupling; Intelligence adds same-basis contract coupling.
' These are local collaborators today, not service assignments; no independent extraction driver.
' Review uncertainty: combined Outfit Advice and Use may merit later separation only with real
' change/ownership evidence; preserve one identity/validity owner and immediate survivor effects.

title CapsuleAI - Logical View\nVersion 0.1 | Baseline Draft
left to right direction
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam defaultFontColor #0F172A
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F1F5F9
  BorderColor #64748B
  FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #475569
  FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #64748B
  FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam legend {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  FontColor #334155
}
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 90

rectangle "Mobile Client\nPrivate user intentions and results" as Mobile <<external client>> #DBEAFE
rectangle "Recovery Email Provider" as Email <<external system>> #FEE2E2
rectangle "Weather Provider" as Weather <<external system>> #CFFAFE
rectangle "Python AI Runtime\nPrivate proposal/preview execution" as AI <<analysis system>> #E0E7FF
rectangle "Private Object Storage\nMedia resource" as Media <<external resource>> #E2E8F0
rectangle "Optional Commercial Provider /\nExternal Shopping Destination" as Shopping <<external system>> #FFEDD5

rectangle "CapsuleAI Business Core - Modular Monolith" as Core #FFFFFF {
    package "Identity" as Identity <<logical context>> #DBEAFE {
        component "Account / Session Authority\nRegistration, credentials, refresh, revocation\nSingle-use recovery and accepted outcomes\nAll protected owners consume usable authority\nRecovery delivery is not reset completion" as Access #EFF6FF
    }
    package "Personal Context" as Context <<logical context>> #CCFBF1 {
        component "Personalization Profile / Selected Context\nDeclared styles, common need priorities\nOptional body/gender and effective withdrawal\nLocation choice; UC-006 environmental acquisition\nConsumers share current / limited context" as Personal #F0FDFA
    }
    package "Wardrobe" as Wardrobe <<logical context>> #DCFCE7 {
        component "Confirmed Garment / Wardrobe Authority\nGarment identity; confirmation / correction truth\nSaveable minimum; eligibility / readiness policy\nBrowse, search, edit, remove; private media\nAnalysis drafts never establish ownership" as Garments #F0FDF4
    }
    package "Outfit Advice and Use" as Outfits <<logical context>> #FEF3C7 {
        component "Owned-Outfit Advice / Reported Use\nDaily choices, Shuffle and soft ranking\nOutfit-targeted feedback; distinct Wear Events\nHistory, utilization, effective aged evidence\nCoherent survivor effects; minimal history\nOriginal local grouping / absolute elapsed aging" as Advice #FFFBEB
        component "Outfit Evaluation Semantics\nGarment-identity-set outfit identity\nHard validity; uses Wardrobe readiness meaning\nOwned / historical / hypothetical distinction\nCaller-supplied inputs; independent of Daily" as Evaluation <<published contract>> #FDE68A
    }
    package "Wardrobe Intelligence" as Intelligence <<logical context>> #EDE9FE {
        component "Coverage / Gaps / Candidate Utility\nWeighted needs; capability gaps; sufficient data\nHypothetical candidates; complete Multiplier\nSame-basis count, states and new-outfit previews\nQualified optional shopping advice\nCandidates/previews create no ownership or Wear" as Assessments #F5F3FF
    }
    component "Product Measurement\nPurpose-minimal interaction evidence\nOwn user-linked measurement lifecycle" as Measurement <<supporting capability>> #FCE7F3
}

' Dependencies point from consumer to the owner/system whose published meaning it needs.
Mobile --> Core : user intentions / outcomes
Access --> Email : recovery delivery
Personal --> Weather : environmental evidence / ACL
Garments --> AI : bounded assistance / ACL
Garments --> Media : authorized media / lifecycle

Advice --> Garments : current garments / readiness
Advice --> Personal : declared context
Advice --> Evaluation : identity / validity
Assessments --> Garments : baseline / readiness
Assessments --> Personal : needs / context
Assessments --> Evaluation : shared outfit semantics
Assessments --> Shopping : optional evidence / navigation; ACL

' One representative event dependency; other FR-MET interactions use the same supporting owner.
Advice ..> Measurement : <<local application event>>

legend bottom
  |= Notation |= Logical meaning |
  | Package <<logical context>> | Human-accepted accountable domain owner; internal models stay private. |
  | Component <<published contract>> | Owner-controlled semantic responsibility, not a code interface or separate context. |
  | Solid arrow | Consumer -> published owner/system; immediate query or coherent collaboration as labeled. |
  | Dotted event arrow | Independent local reaction; scheduling/delivery design remains downstream. |
  | External rectangle | Client, provider, analysis execution or resource boundary; not a business context. |
  Published contracts only; private persistence/models remain isolated. ACL is not a snapshot store.
  Repeated authorization dependencies and other specified measurement-fact arrows are omitted.
  Provider exchanges are purpose-minimal; ACL protects proposals/environment/commercial meaning.
  AI returns preview + proposals, never confirmation. Private media association/purge is recoverable.
  Current request occasion stays separate from common needs; manual location does not need permission.
  Wardrobe detail combines published garment and reported-use queries without mutual owner calls.
  Wardrobe publishes readiness for owned/candidate evaluation without adding hypothetical ownership.
  Intelligence applies the published policy to complete sets, never to Daily's displayed subset.
  Relevant inputs/rules changing require reevaluation or Outdated before current advice is claimed.
  Revocation, effective removal, Wear effects and current assessment basis need immediate coherence.
  New Wear acceptance coordinates current Wardrobe ownership/readiness with Outfit Advice and Use.
  Owners coordinate locally; later design may use local ACID. Exact transactions remain unresolved.
  Mutation owners retain durable logical-action outcomes; retry differs from a new Wear intention.
  Required physical deletion is owner-accountable, durable/resumable work after effective removal.
  Measurement reacts independently; failure cannot block/undo core acceptance or fabricate evidence.
  Its lifecycle differs from functional history. A local event implies neither async nor durability.
  No universal Shared Kernel, dedicated cache or broker. Contexts are not service/deployment choices.
  Derived-result ownership does not select a permanent store; Clean realization is in Implementation View.
  Next: Implementation View review -> Deployment View.
endlegend

@enduml
